100 REM FILL THE SCREEN -- X16 BASIC, VERA
110 REM SCREEN 128 IS 320X240 IN 256 COLOURS; RECT FILLS A RECTANGLE.
120 REM 200 FULL-SCREEN FILLS, TIMED BY TI.
130 PRINT "FILL THE SCREEN 200 TIMES, 320X240, X16 BASIC"
140 SCREEN 128
200 T=TI
210 FOR I=1 TO 200
215 C=1+(I AND 15)
220 RECT 0,0,319,239,C
230 NEXT
240 T=TI-T
250 POKE 40885,2:REM $9FB5: RECORD A FEW GIF FRAMES FOR THE RECORD
252 T=TI
254 IF TI-T<20 THEN 254
256 POKE 40885,0
260 SCREEN 0
300 PRINT "RESULT FILL";T/60;"S"
310 PRINT "DONE"
